      <mxCell id="cell_6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;AuthService&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Google SSO &amp;amp; Mail FPT&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #60a5fa; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Enforce @fpt.edu.vn&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Firebase Auth Token&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• User state sync&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#60a5fa;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="60" y="405" width="230" height="105" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;FirestoreService&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Atomic Transaction Engine&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #34d399; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• runTransaction: Check-in&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Snapshot streams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Zero-mock policy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="310" y="405" width="260" height="105" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;StorageService&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Cloud Storage Handler&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #fbbf24; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Upload PDF e-Cert&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Path: reports/{uid}/&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Signed download URL&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#fbbf24;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="590" y="405" width="240" height="105" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;FCMService &amp;amp; RemoteConfig&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Cloud Messaging &amp;amp; Config&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #c084fc; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Push thông báo duyệt vé&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Topic broadcast&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• max_featured_events flag&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="850" y="405" width="260" height="105" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;GeminiAiService&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Google GenAI Flash 1.5&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #c084fc; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Multi-key pool (10 keys)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Round-robin failover&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Phân tích phản hồi sinh viên&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="1130" y="405" width="250" height="105" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;HẠ TẦNG ĐÁM MÂY GOOGLE FIREBASE (CLOUD BACKEND - PROJECT: CAMPUS-EVENT-48443)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Toàn bộ dữ liệu vận hành thực tế 100% trên đám mây Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/div&gt;
      
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="560" width="1370" height="220" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_12" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Firebase Authentication&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Identity Toolkit &amp;amp; OAuth2&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #60a5fa; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Đăng nhập tài khoản trường FPT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Xác thực hai lớp qua Google&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Cấp JWT Token định danh&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#60a5fa;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="60" y="615" width="250" height="140" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_13" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Cloud Firestore (NoSQL Document Database)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Multi-Region High Availability &amp;amp; Sub-second Query&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #34d399; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Collections: events, tickets, registrations, clubs, feedback, certificates, announcements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Compound Indexes: Lọc vé theo sinh viên và trạng thái check-in&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Security Rules: Phân quyền truy cập tài liệu nghiêm ngặt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#ecfdf5;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="330" y="615" width="450" height="140" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Firebase Cloud Storage&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Bảo mật lưu trữ chứng nhận số&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #fbbf24; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Lưu trữ PDF e-Certificate SHA-256&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Quy tắc bảo mật theo UID người dùng&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Hỗ trợ tải ngoại tuyến&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#fbbf24;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="800" y="615" width="280" height="140" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;FCM &amp;amp; Crashlytics / Analytics&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Hệ thống vận hành viễn trắc&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #c084fc; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• FCM Push Gateway độ trễ thấp&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Crashlytics bắt lỗi Crash thời gian thực&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• Google Analytics DebugView&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="1100" y="615" width="280" height="140" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;CÁC QUYẾT ĐỊNH KIẾN TRÚC &amp;amp; ĐÁNH ĐỔI (ARCHITECTURAL DECISIONS &amp;amp; TRADE-OFFS):&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;Lựa chọn công nghệ phục vụ trực tiếp cho tiêu chí vận hành thực tế của Đại học FPT TP.HCM&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #94a3b8; font-size:10px; color:#334155; line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• 1. Quyết định chọn Cloud Firestore NoSQL thay vì RDBMS truyền thống: Đạt tốc độ truy vấn sub-second (&amp;lt; 1.5s khi quét vé tại cổng), snapshot stream tự động đẩy dữ liệu tức thì giữa điện thoại sinh viên và cổng soát vé. Đánh đổi: Cần thiết kế cấu trúc dữ liệu phẳng hóa, hạn chế join nhiều bảng.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• 2. Quyết định mô hình MVVM + Provider trên Flutter: Tách biệt hoàn toàn tầng hiển thị khỏi nghiệp vụ, giúp mã nguồn dễ bảo trì, dễ viết kiểm thử tự động (đạt 21/21 Unit/Widget Tests pass 100%), không gây re-render thừa.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:2px;&quot;&gt;• 3. Cơ chế Multi-Key Round Robin cho Gemini AI: Sử dụng bể 10 API Key chính thức kèm tự động xoay tua khi gặp lỗi HTTP 429 Quota Exceeded, đảm bảo hệ sinh thái AI hoạt động liên tục không gián đoạn.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="805" width="1370" height="160" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
    </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
</diagram>
</mxfile>